<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Petroz half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Petroz half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  4.65 vs  3.55</p>
<p>    Net profit			  3.47 vs  2.37</p>
<p>    Sales				14.83 vs 17.97</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Petroz NL is an oil and gas producer with operations in the Timor Sea between Australia and Indonesia, and Queensland's onshore Surat Basin.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
